From: Maoweicao <Maoweicao@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 18:26:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat(i18n): convert all menu files to use translations

- MainMenu: translate title, status labels, component names, changelog
- SettingsMenu: add language selector (option 6) with interactive dialog
- SettingsMenu: translate all labels, repository info, toggle descriptions
- InstallMenu: translate section headers
- UpdateMenu: translate title, headers, status messages, system update dialogs
- RemoveMenu: translate title and info message
- AdvancedMenu: translate title and all menu item labels
- BackupMenu: translate title, section headers, info label
- RepoSelectMenu: translate title, repo labels, add/remove dialogs
